            {
              "text": "They shared their food and rested together under the large trees.",
              "audioStart": 176.963,
              "audioEnd": 180.262
            },
            {
              "text": "Every step they took brought them closer to the dark island.",
              "audioStart": 181.125,
              "audioEnd": 183.975
            },
            {
              "text": "The local people had suffered for years because of the bad creatures.",
              "audioStart": 184.838,
              "audioEnd": 188.312
            },
            {
              "text": "Now, hope was returning to the land because Momotaro was coming.",
              "audioStart": 189.175,
              "audioEnd": 192.85
            },
            {
              "text": "The wind blew softly as the small boat moved across the waves.",
              "audioStart": 193.713,
              "audioEnd": 196.963
            },
            {
              "text": "They knew the fight ahead would require all their strength and skill.",
              "audioStart": 197.825,
              "audioEnd": 200.863
            },
            {
              "text": "The dog kept watch while the bird flew high to check the path.",
              "audioStart": 201.725,
              "audioEnd": 204.85
            },
            {
              "text": "The other animal helped carry the heavy bags of food and supplies.",
              "audioStart": 205.713,
              "audioEnd": 209.2
            },
            {
              "text": "Nothing could stop them because their goal was clear and true.",
              "audioStart": 210.062,
              "audioEnd": 212.963
            },
            {
              "text": "When they finally touched the sand of the island, they prepared for battle.",
              "audioStart": 213.825,
              "audioEnd": 217.312
            },
            {
              "text": "The enemies tried to look fierce, but the small team was not afraid.",
              "audioStart": 218.175,
              "audioEnd": 221.787
            },
            {
              "text": "The fight was hard, but friendship and teamwork won the day.",
              "audioStart": 222.65,
              "audioEnd": 225.738
            },
            {
              "text": "After the battle, the land was peaceful and quiet once again.",
              "audioStart": 226.6,
              "audioEnd": 229.938
            },
            {
              "text": "The people of the country thanked Momotaro with all their heart.",
              "audioStart": 230.8,
              "audioEnd": 233.825
            },
            {
              "text": "He smiled and told them that friends are the greatest treasure of all.",
              "audioStart": 234.688,
              "audioEnd": 237.775
            }
          ]
        }
